# mcl_hq.phases.pdl - scripted playthrough of mcl-hq through its REAL verbs (roadmap D4/C3 family). Row formats: see cdda_hq.phases.pdl and BOOK 06-testing/GAME-PLAYTHROUGH-HARNESSES.md
GAME | mcl-hq | mcl_hq
INIT | state/flag_int.txt | 1
INIT | state/flag_running.txt | 1
INIT | state/active.txt | rex\n
INIT | state/pet_rex.txt | room=city\nx=14\ny=4\ndir=2\nsteps=1\ntx=-1\nty=-1\n

PHASE | p1_mine | mine a stone and two logs; mining an empty cell is refused | mine, stone, log, bag
DO | bag
SAY | bag empty | empty-bag-at-start
DO | mine | 12 | 9
SAY | no block at 12,9 | mining-an-empty-cell-is-refused
DO | mine | 15 | 4
SAY | mined stone (bag 1) | mine-stone
DO | mine | 15 | 7
SAY | mined log (bag 1) | mine-first-log
DO | mine | 15 | 8
SAY | mined log (bag 2) | mine-second-log
DO | bag
SAYIS | stone 1, log 2 (holding stone) | bag-holds-stone-and-two-logs
DO | inventory
SAY | rex:stone=1 | ledger-says-one-stone
SAY | rex:log=2 | ledger-says-two-logs
UI | n_inv | 2 | inventory-tab-has-two-rows
UI | inv_0_label | stone x1 (held) | inventory-tab-stone-row-is-held
COUNT | state/events.txt | EVENT\p | 3 | three-event-rows
COUNT | state/events.txt | EVRES\p | 3 | three-resolved-rows

PHASE | p2_craft | craft planks twice from the logs; the third craft has no log | craft, planks, recipe
DO | craft | planks
SAY | crafted planks x4 (bag 4) | first-craft
DO | bag
SAYIS | stone 1, log 1, planks 4 (holding stone) | one-log-used
DO | craft | planks
SAY | crafted planks x4 (bag 8) | second-craft
DO | craft | planks
NOSAY | crafted | third-craft-has-no-log
DO | bag
SAYIS | stone 1, planks 8 (holding stone) | bag-after-two-crafts
DO | craft | sword
SAY | no recipe named sword | unknown-recipe-refused
UI | n_rec | 1 | craft-tab-one-recipe
UI | rec_0_label | planks x4 | craft-tab-recipe-row

PHASE | p3_place | hold planks and place one; a taken cell, scenery, and a block not in the bag are refused; a placed block stops a walker until it is mined | hold, place, refuse, block, step
DO | hold
SAY | holding planks (8) | hold-switches-to-planks
DO | place | 15 | 4
SAY | placed planks at 15,4 (bag 7) | place-succeeds
DO | place | 15 | 5
SAY | cannot place at 15,5: not free | place-on-a-block-refused
DO | place | 9 | 2
SAY | cannot place at 9,2: not free | place-on-scenery-refused
DO | place | dirt | 12 | 9
SAY | dirt: none to place | place-a-block-not-in-the-bag-refused
HAS | state/chat.txt | Rex cannot place planks: the cell is taken | refusal-is-logged
DO | bag
SAYIS | stone 1, planks 7 (holding planks) | bag-after-place
NOTE | state surgery: put Rex back on the cell left of the placed block
PUT | state/pet_rex.txt | room=city\nx=14\ny=4\ndir=2\nsteps=1\ntx=-1\nty=-1\n
DO | step | 1 | 0
HAS | state/pet_rex.txt | x=14 | placed-block-stops-the-walker
DO | mine | 15 | 4
SAY | mined planks (bag 8) | mine-the-placed-block
DO | step | 1 | 0
HAS | state/pet_rex.txt | x=15 | walker-passes-once-mined

PHASE | p4_saveload | save to slot 1, new game brings the rock back and empties the bag, load slot 1 restores both | save, load, newgame, slot
DO | inventory
CAP | inv_saved
DO | save | 1
SAY | saved to slot 1 | save-reports-slot-1
DO | newgame
SAY | new game started | newgame-reports
DO | bag
SAY | bag empty | newgame-empties-the-bag
DO | mine | 15 | 4
SAY | mined stone (bag 1) | newgame-stone-block-is-back
DO | load | 1
SAY | loaded from slot 1 | load-reports-slot-1
DO | inventory
CAP | inv_loaded
EQ | inv_saved | inv_loaded | load-restores-the-same-bags

PHASE | p5_replay | a fresh game fed the same event ledger replays to the same bags AND the same blocks | replay, ledger, determinism, blocks
DO | inventory
CAP | inv_before
CP | state/events.txt | state/events.keep
DO | newgame
DO | inventory
SAYIS | (nothing) | fresh-game-has-nothing
DO | mine | 15 | 7
SAY | mined log | fresh-game-has-the-log-block-back
CP | state/events.keep | state/events.txt
DO | inventory
CAP | inv_replayed
EQ | inv_before | inv_replayed | replay-equals-the-bags
DO | mine | 15 | 7
SAY | no block at 15,7 | replay-reopens-the-mined-block
